=========================================
Nightly Ephemeral Runner Ghost Buster Report
=========================================

Execution Details:
- Date: {{ ansible_date_time.date }}
- Time: {{ ansible_date_time.time }}
- Dry Run Mode: {{ dry_run | default(false) }}
- Max Age Threshold: {{ max_age_hours }} hours

GitHub Configuration:
- Organization: {{ github_org }}
- Repository: {{ github_repo }}
- Registered Runners: {{ registered_runners | length }}

Cloud Provider Results:
{% for result in cleanup_results %}
{{ result.provider | upper }}:
  - Instances Scanned: {{ result.total_scanned }}
  - Orphaned Found: {{ result.orphaned_found }}
  - Old Orphaned (>{{ max_age_hours }}h): {{ result.old_orphaned }}
  {% if result.instances | length > 0 %}
  Instances Details:
  {% for instance in result.instances %}
    - {{ instance.name }} ({{ instance.instance_id | default(instance.vm_id) }})
      {% if instance.age_hours is defined %}
      - Age: {{ instance.age_hours | round(2) }} hours
      {% endif %}
      - Tags: {{ instance.tags | to_nice_json }}
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}

{% endfor %}

Cleanup Actions Taken:
{% if dry_run | default(false) %}
[DRY RUN] No actual cleanup performed
{% else %}
- AWS EC2 instances terminated: {{ cleanup_results | selectattr('provider', 'equalto', 'aws') | map(attribute='old_orphaned') | sum | default(0) }}
- Azure VMs terminated: {{ cleanup_results | selectattr('provider', 'equalto', 'azure') | map(attribute='old_orphaned') | sum | default(0) }}
- GCP instances terminated: {{ cleanup_results | selectattr('provider', 'equalto', 'gcp') | map(attribute='old_orphaned') | sum | default(0) }}
{% endif %}

Cost Savings Estimate:
{% set aws_cost_per_hour = 0.02 %}
{% set azure_cost_per_hour = 0.02 %}
{% set gcp_cost_per_hour = 0.02 %}
{% set total_savings = [] %}

{% for result in cleanup_results %}
{% if result.provider == 'aws' %}
{% for instance in result.instances %}
{% if instance.age_hours is defined %}
{% set _ = total_savings.append(instance.age_hours * aws_cost_per_hour) %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% elif result.provider == 'azure' %}
{% for instance in result.instances %}
{% if instance.age_hours is defined %}
{% set _ = total_savings.append(instance.age_hours * azure_cost_per_hour) %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% elif result.provider == 'gcp' %}
{% for instance in result.instances %}
{% if instance.age_hours is defined %}
{% set _ = total_savings.append(instance.age_hours * gcp_cost_per_hour) %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

Estimated Total Savings: ${{ (total_savings | sum | default(0)) | round(2) }}

